                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 2867,
                            "last_played": 1722798493
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Some of the best writing I have had the pleasure of seeing in any game I've played recently, coupled with sound and visual design that greatly improve the....immersion of the game. The story and the characters—especially the protagonist—are compelling, and the puzzles are quite fun. I often find myself excited or intrigued by some new scrap of information or dialogue I find, and have to discuss it with my friends. The ties between this game and the previous one are subtle but wonderful—the links between the stories of the two games are absolutely fascinating to piece together. And the community is lovely.\n\nAll in all an excellent game.",
